# R8 keep rules for the release build (AGP combines every file in src/main/keepRules).
# See https://d.android.com/r/tools/r8/keep-rules

# Our enums are stored by name: in saved settings (DataStore, e.g. "MuslimWorldLeague", "Dark")
# and in the extras of scheduled prayer alarms, which survive an app update. If R8 renamed the
# enum constants, an updated app would no longer recognise settings or alarms saved by the old one.
# Keep the constant names; R8 may still optimise everything else in the enum.
-keepclassmembernames enum com.universalazan.app.** {
    public static final ** *;
}

# Don't move Kotlin standard-library classes into other packages. With partial optimisation
# (packageScope) R8 moved kotlin.sequences.SequencesKt___SequencesJvmKt out of its package while
# its package-private parent class stayed behind, and the release build crashed on start-up with
# IllegalAccessError (found in the Stage 12 release smoke test).
-keeppackagenames kotlin.**
